                  No powder is completely free of heavy metals, but some have published low results. In Consumer Reports' October 2025 testing, Optimum Nutrition Gold Standard 100% Whey and BSN Syntha-6 were among its better choices for daily use. In its January 2026 follow-up, Clean Simple Eats chocolate had the lowest lead of five powders tested, as reported in coverage.
                </p>
