          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            There is no heavy-metal-free protein powder, but there are powders with published results showing low lead. On the evidence through early 2026, dairy-based powders in vanilla or lightly flavored versions test lowest, and Consumer Reports' testing gives specific products to choose from.
